@host = http://localhost:5031

### Create a proposal
POST {{host}}/api/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Shadow board for torque wrenches",
  "description": "Operators spend ~5 min per shift searching for the right wrench.",
  "area": "Assembly"
}

### List all proposals
GET {{host}}/api/proposals

### List by status
GET {{host}}/api/proposals?status=Submitted

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/proposals/1

### Status workflow: Submitted → UnderReview → Approved → Completed (or → Rejected).
### Replace 1 with the id returned by "Create a proposal".

### Skipping approval is rejected with 409 Conflict
PATCH {{host}}/api/proposals/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Move to review
PATCH {{host}}/api/proposals/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "UnderReview"
}

### Approve
PATCH {{host}}/api/proposals/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}

### Complete (sets completedAt)
PATCH {{host}}/api/proposals/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Lead-time metrics: average days from submission to completion, by area
GET {{host}}/api/metrics/lead-time
